1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,046
Hey everyone!

2
00:00:01,046 --> 00:00:03,498
Welcome to Day 1 of building in public.

3
00:00:03,602 --> 00:00:05,727
Today, I want to show you something I've been working on.

4
00:00:05,834 --> 00:00:08,524
It's an interactive Koi Fish wallpaper.

5
00:00:08,642 --> 00:00:14,325
Just click anywhere on the water to drop some fish food, and watch the koi swim towards it and start eating.

6
00:00:14,325 --> 00:00:19,578
If the food lands on a lotus leaf, the leaves actually move and react to it.

7
00:00:19,682 --> 00:00:30,113
I've also added a lot of little details to make the pond feel alive: realistic water ripples, tiny air bubbles, soft shadows from the lotus flowers, and much more.

8
00:00:30,218 --> 00:00:32,608
You can customize the experience, too.

9
00:00:32,714 --> 00:00:41,642
Change the number of fish in the pond, adjust the frame rate up to 144 FPS, and choose the rendering quality, from low all the way up to Ultra.

10
00:00:41,762 --> 00:00:43,299
But this is just the beginning.

11
00:00:43,634 --> 00:00:52,851
I'm thinking of adding a day-and-night cycle, so you can experience the pond under moonlight, along with a rainy weather effect, where raindrops create ripples across the water.

12
00:00:52,970 --> 00:00:54,026
And one more thing.

13
00:00:54,842 --> 00:01:00,669
I'm also looking for someone with a similar mindset, who enjoys building products and experimenting with ideas.

14
00:01:00,770 --> 00:01:08,376
I've worked on Android development, and I'd love to collaborate, build, launch, and potentially sell products together.

15
00:01:08,474 --> 00:01:10,852
I think building together is more fun.

16
00:01:10,852 --> 00:01:15,143
You share ideas, learn from each other, and create better things.

17
00:01:15,242 --> 00:01:18,137
If that sounds interesting, feel free to DM me.

18
00:01:18,137 --> 00:01:19,783
Let's build something together!

